     "title": "Casa Verde Hotels: 2026–27 brief",
     "text": "# Casa Verde Hotels: 2026–27 brief\n\nClient: Casa Verde Hotels (boutique hotels in Mexico)\nAgency: Brightline Studio\nAccount lead: Inês Duarte\nDate: 15 September 2026\n\n## Goal\nGrow direct bookings by 20% by the end of Q2 2027, so the hotels depend less on booking platforms.\n\n## Properties\n- Tulum (open)\n- Oaxaca (open, joining the Casa Verde brand in September)\n- Valle de Bravo (new, opening 15 February 2027)\n\n## Budget\nAnnual media budget: €180,000. Any change above 10% needs approval from Rafael Ortega, Commercial Director.\n\n## Contacts\nSofía Medina, Marketing Manager, is our day-to-day contact. Rafael Ortega approves budgets.\n\n## Tone\nWarm and local. The client does not want discount-led messaging: talk about experiences, not prices.",
     "original": null,
