     "title": "Casa Verde Hotels: monthly review (October)",
     "text": "# Casa Verde Hotels: monthly review (October)\n\nExported from Minuta · 27 October 2026 · Attendees: Daniel Reyes, Priya Nair (Brightline Studio), Sofía Medina (Casa Verde Hotels)\n\n## Summary\nDirect bookings rose 14% month on month, led by Tulum. The October report wrongly listed Oaxaca as a separate brand, and Sofía's director noticed. Casa Verde opens Valle de Bravo in March and wants a launch plan. A new head of marketing, Carla Ruiz, starts on 10 November and will review all agencies in her first month.\n\n## Tasks created\n- Resend October report with Oaxaca under Casa Verde Hotels (Priya Nair, due 28 Oct)\n- Send Valle de Bravo launch plan outline (Daniel Reyes, due 10 Nov)\n- Chase approval of December holiday creatives (Daniel Reyes, due 3 Nov)\n- Prepare results one-pager and book intro with Carla Ruiz (Daniel Reyes, due 13 Nov)",
