     "text": "# Team notes: Casa Verde\n\nInternal, Brightline Studio. Last updated 30 October 2026.\n\n- Sofía prefers a quick call to long emails. Send a two-line summary after every call.\n- Marco Bianchi (freelance video editor) is cutting the holiday video. Final delivery is 6 November.\n- Priya Nair owns reporting for the account.\n- Risk: Carla Ruiz joins as Head of Marketing on 10 November and will review all agencies. We need to show results early.\n- Rafael Ortega has signed off budget changes within a day in the past, so ask early rather than late.",
